<div class="col-span-12 mb-6">
  <% empty_state('Not a Karafka Error', icon: 'document') do %>
    This offset holds a message that is not a valid Karafka error report.

    <p class="mt-2">
      It was most likely produced to this topic by something other than Karafka's error
      tracking (for example a message published to it by mistake). The Web UI can only display
      messages that follow the Karafka error schema.
    </p>
  <% end %>
</div>
